  "question": {
    "text": "The set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which the equation&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> has a solution is",
