  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />i.e. <math><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>or</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>The range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math><mo>[</mo><mn>2,6</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p>",
